{"timestamp":"2026-08-31T11:11:26.288Z","level":"WARN","service":"3dgalaxy-backend","environment":"development","module":"HTTP","message":"Slow API Warning: HTTP PUT /api/products/37783d07-db80-4458-b9fd-8995645dc73e took 2761ms (threshold: 1500ms)","errorCode":"SLOW_API_RESPONSE","metadata":{"requestId":"req_mth51cas_3vhu","userId":"8e73170e-35ba-470e-94b5-498e6189bd7e","route":"/api/products/37783d07-db80-4458-b9fd-8995645dc73e","method":"PUT","statusCode":200,"durationMs":2761,"metadata":{"body":{"name":"Creality HALOT-LITE","slug":"creality-halot-lite","brand":"ac20995a-cd2b-4183-a53c-4f4ef658a9e5","category_id":"818c760a-e5d6-42fa-a68d-78bf45f3659d","sku":"creality-halot-lite","barcode":"1788******524","mrp":70000,"sale_price":"57000","dealer_price":"57000","stock":0,"description":"<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0595/2464/5057/files/crealityholtlite-1_480x480.jpg?v=1682596607\"></p>\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\"><img style=\"float: left;\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0595/2464/5057/files/crealityholtlite-2_480x480.jpg?v=1682596689\"></div>\n<h3 class=\"a-spacing-mini\">Creality Halot Lite Resin 3D Printer</h3>\n<h4 class=\"a-spacing-mini a-color-secondary a-text-italic\">Creality Self-developed Integral Light Source</h4>\n<p class=\"a-spacing-base\">Halot Lite adopts the Self-developed integral light source, which makes the light intensity distribution of the whole screen uniform and consistent accuracy. Using 8.9\" 4K Monochrome LCD, which can reach high precision, high saturation and 80%+ uniformity.</p>\n<div class=\"amp-centerthirdcol-listbox\">\n<div class=\"a-box a-spacing-small a-color-alternate-background apm-listbox amp-centerthirdcol-listbox\">\n<div class=\"a-box-inner\" style=\"text-align: left;\">\n<ul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical\">\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\"><span class=\"a-size-base\">Self-developed High Performance Mainboard</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\"><span class=\"a-size-base\">8.9 Inch Monochrome LCD of 4K HD 3840*2400 Resolution</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\"><span class=\"a-size-base\">Efficient Cooling and Filtration System</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\"><span class=\"a-size-base\">Creality New Slicing Software HALOT BOX</span></span></li>\n<li>\n<span class=\"a-list-item\"><span class=\"a-size-base\">Larger Printing Size 192*120*200mm</span></span> <span class=\"a-list-item\"><span class=\"a-size-base\"><img data-src=\"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/3152727f-04f3-411c-9c02-160bb25a96ea.__CR0,0,350,175_PT0_SX350_V1___.jpg\" class=\"a-spacing-mini\" src=\"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/3152727f-04f3-411c-9c02-160bb25a96ea.__CR0,0,350,175_PT0_SX350_V1___.jpg\" alt=\"1\"></span></span>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h5 class=\"a-color-secondary\">CREALITY</h5>\n<p class=\"a-spacing-small a-size-small a-color-secondary\">Creality is the evangelist of 3D printing industry. We work to design quality, innovative, easy-to-use 3D printers that inspire our customers to create reality and achieve dreams.</p>\n<p class=\"a-spacing-small a-size-small a-color-secondary\">We are committed to transcending the limits of creality ,narrows the gap of family connection,endows better education condition to your children and makes your dreams shine with the glitter of stars and ocean.</p>\n<p class=\"a-spacing-small a-size-small a-color-secondary\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0595/2464/5057/files/crealityholtlite-3_480x480.jpg?v=1682596795\" style=\"float: right;\"></p>\n<h4 class=\"a-spacing-mini\" style=\"text-align: left;\">High Precision Integral Light Source</h4>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Self-developed integral light source adopts the reflection &amp; refraction to make the light intensity distribution of the whole screen uniform, the uniformity of light source energy can reach more than 80%. When the individual lamp beads are attenuated, the uniformity of the printed model is not affected.</p>\n<p> <br></p>\n<p> <br></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0595/2464/5057/files/crealityholtlite-4_480x480.jpg?v=1682596895\" style=\"float: left;\"></p>\n<h4 class=\"a-spacing-mini\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Capture Details</h4>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Creality Halot Lite 3D Printers comes with a 4K 8.9-inch Monochrome LCD with 3840*2400 resolution. Which means faster printing speed, higher printing efficiency and precision.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"> <br></p>\n<p> <br></p>\n<p> <br></p>\n<p> <br></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0595/2464/5057/files/crealityholtlite-5_480x480.jpg?v=1682597034\" style=\"float: right;\"></p>\n<h4 class=\"a-spacing-mini\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Efficient Cooling and Filtration</h4>\n<h4 class=\"a-spacing-mini\" style=\"text-align: left;\">System</h4>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Specially designed dual heat dissipation system, precise and intelligent control to detect and evaporate heat. Activated carbon air filtration can effectively reduce the odor emission and offer you a refreshing printing experience.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"> <br></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"> <br></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"> </p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0595/2464/5057/files/crealityholtlite-6_480x480.jpg?v=1682597135\" style=\"float: left;\"></p>\n<h4 class=\"a-spacing-mini\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Larger Printing Size</h4>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">192*120*200mm molding space to realize your creative potential. More larger model you needed can be printed with this printer.</p>\n<p> <br></p>\n<p> <br></p>\n<p> <br></p>\n<p> <br></p>\n<p> <br></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0595/2464/5057/files/crealityholtlite-7_480x480.jpg?v=1682597202\" style=\"float: right;\"></p>\n<h4 class=\"a-spacing-mini\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Wifi/APP Remote Control</h4>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Creality Cloud App for mornitor printing progress, adjust the printing settings. Built-in Wifi allows one-click upgrades to the firmware.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"> <br></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"> <br></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"> <br></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"> <br></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"> <br></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"> <br></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0595/2464/5057/files/crealityholtlite-8_480x480.jpg?v=1682597272\" style=\"float: left;\"></p>\n<h4 class=\"a-spacing-mini\">5'' Color Touch Screen</h4>\n<p>5-inch color touch screen with simple visual interface for you to easily control the operation of Halot Lite.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0595/2464/5057/files/crealityholtlite-9_480x480.jpg?v=1682597308\" width=\"548\" height=\"169\"></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>","long_description":"<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0595/2464/5057/files/crealityholtlite-1_480x480.jpg?v=1682596607\"></p>\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\"><img style=\"float: left;\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0595/2464/5057/files/crealityholtlite-2_480x480.jpg?v=1682596689\"></div>\n<h3 class=\"a-spacing-mini\">Creality Halot Lite Resin 3D Printer</h3>\n<h4 class=\"a-spacing-mini a-color-secondary a-text-italic\">Creality Self-developed Integral Light Source</h4>\n<p class=\"a-spacing-base\">Halot Lite adopts the Self-developed integral light source, which makes the light intensity distribution of the whole screen uniform and consistent accuracy. Using 8.9\" 4K Monochrome LCD, which can reach high precision, high saturation and 80%+ uniformity.</p>\n<div class=\"amp-centerthirdcol-listbox\">\n<div class=\"a-box a-spacing-small a-color-alternate-background apm-listbox amp-centerthirdcol-listbox\">\n<div class=\"a-box-inner\" style=\"text-align: left;\">\n<ul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical\">\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\"><span class=\"a-size-base\">Self-developed High Performance Mainboard</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\"><span class=\"a-size-base\">8.9 Inch Monochrome LCD of 4K HD 3840*2400 Resolution</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\"><span class=\"a-size-base\">Efficient Cooling and Filtration System</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"a-list-item\"><span class=\"a-size-base\">Creality New Slicing Software HALOT BOX</span></span></li>\n<li>\n<span class=\"a-list-item\"><span class=\"a-size-base\">Larger Printing Size 192*120*200mm</span></span> <span class=\"a-list-item\"><span class=\"a-size-base\"><img data-src=\"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/3152727f-04f3-411c-9c02-160bb25a96ea.__CR0,0,350,175_PT0_SX350_V1___.jpg\" class=\"a-spacing-mini\" src=\"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/3152727f-04f3-411c-9c02-160bb25a96ea.__CR0,0,350,175_PT0_SX350_V1___.jpg\" alt=\"1\"></span></span>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h5 class=\"a-color-secondary\">CREALITY</h5>\n<p class=\"a-spacing-small a-size-small a-color-secondary\">Creality is the evangelist of 3D printing industry. We work to design quality, innovative, easy-to-use 3D printers that inspire our customers to create reality and achieve dreams.</p>\n<p class=\"a-spacing-small a-size-small a-color-secondary\">We are committed to transcending the limits of creality ,narrows the gap of family connection,endows better education condition to your children and makes your dreams shine with the glitter of stars and ocean.</p>\n<p class=\"a-spacing-small a-size-small a-color-secondary\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0595/2464/5057/files/crealityholtlite-3_480x480.jpg?v=1682596795\" style=\"float: right;\"></p>\n<h4 class=\"a-spacing-mini\" style=\"text-align: left;\">High Precision Integral Light Source</h4>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Self-developed integral light source adopts the reflection &amp; refraction to make the light intensity distribution of the whole screen uniform, the uniformity of light source energy can reach more than 80%. When the individual lamp beads are attenuated, the uniformity of the printed model is not affected.</p>\n<p> <br></p>\n<p> <br></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0595/2464/5057/files/crealityholtlite-4_480x480.jpg?v=1682596895\" style=\"float: left;\"></p>\n<h4 class=\"a-spacing-mini\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Capture Details</h4>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Creality Halot Lite 3D Printers comes with a 4K 8.9-inch Monochrome LCD with 3840*2400 resolution. Which means faster printing speed, higher printing efficiency and precision.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"> <br></p>\n<p> <br></p>\n<p> <br></p>\n<p> <br></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0595/2464/5057/files/crealityholtlite-5_480x480.jpg?v=1682597034\" style=\"float: right;\"></p>\n<h4 class=\"a-spacing-mini\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Efficient Cooling and Filtration</h4>\n<h4 class=\"a-spacing-mini\" style=\"text-align: left;\">System</h4>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Specially designed dual heat dissipation system, precise and intelligent control to detect and evaporate heat. Activated carbon air filtration can effectively reduce the odor emission and offer you a refreshing printing experience.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"> <br></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"> <br></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"> </p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0595/2464/5057/files/crealityholtlite-6_480x480.jpg?v=1682597135\" style=\"float: left;\"></p>\n<h4 class=\"a-spacing-mini\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Larger Printing Size</h4>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">192*120*200mm molding space to realize your creative potential. More larger model you needed can be printed with this printer.</p>\n<p> <br></p>\n<p> <br></p>\n<p> <br></p>\n<p> <br></p>\n<p> <br></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0595/2464/5057/files/crealityholtlite-7_480x480.jpg?v=1682597202\" style=\"float: right;\"></p>\n<h4 class=\"a-spacing-mini\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Wifi/APP Remote Control</h4>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Creality Cloud App for mornitor printing progress, adjust the printing settings. Built-in Wifi allows one-click upgrades to the firmware.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"> <br></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"> <br></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"> <br></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"> <br></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"> <br></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"> <br></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0595/2464/5057/files/crealityholtlite-8_480x480.jpg?v=1682597272\" style=\"float: left;\"></p>\n<h4 class=\"a-spacing-mini\">5'' Color Touch Screen</h4>\n<p>5-inch color touch screen with simple visual interface for you to easily control the operation of Halot Lite.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0595/2464/5057/files/crealityholtlite-9_480x480.jpg?v=1682597308\" width=\"548\" height=\"169\"></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>","images":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444058613-149048164.jpg","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444058656-520846882.jpg","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444058606-283798262.jpg","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444058612-944845930.jpg","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444060011-33155368.jpg","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444060171-189999310.jpg","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444060466-499798035.jpg","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444060961-217524964.jpg","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444060935-732378218.jpg"],"variants":[{"id":"2aaad157-770f-471a-b13d-fbd52d96c99e","name":"Default Title","sku":"creality-halot-lite-Default Title","price":70000,"salePrice":57000,"stock":0,"weight":20000,"variantImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444058613-149048164.jpg"],"optionValues":{"Title":"Default Title"},"isActive":true,"isDefault":false}],"options":[{"id":"Title","name":"Title","variantName":"Title","displayName":"Title","displayType":"chip","selectionMode":"single","required":true,"active":true,"bundleTiers":[],"sortOrder":0,"values":[{"value":"Default Title","displayValue":"Default Title","sortOrder":0}]}],"status":"active","seoTitle":"","seoDescription":"","isFeatured":false,"featured":false,"codAvailable":true,"baseShippingCharge":0,"estimatedDeliveryDays":305,"freeShippingEligible":true,"weightInGrams":0,"weight_in_grams":0,"bundleProducts":[],"recommendedFilaments":[],"is360Supported":false,"tags":["ac20995a-cd2b-4183-a53c-4f4ef658a9e5"],"specs":[],"specifications":[],"downloads":[],"features":[],"faqs":[],"warranty":{},"shipping":{"mode":"default","shippingCharges":0,"freeShippingEligible":true},"relatedProducts":[],"reviews":[],"qnas":[]}}}}
